## Why This Is Asked
Tests for offline-first PWAs are a common beginner challenge, ensuring service workers and syncing work under real user conditions.

## Key Concepts
- Offline-first UX and service worker caching
- E2E data seeding for deterministic tests
- Network control via intercepts (cy.intercept / route)
- Idempotent sync and duplicate prevention

## Code Example
```javascript
// Cypress example sketch
cy.request('POST', '/api/test/setup', {user:'test', products:[101,102]});
cy.visit('/');
cy.intercept('/api/cart', { statusCode: 503 }).as('cartOffline');
cy.get('#add-101').click();
cy.get('#add-102').click();
cy.intercept('/api/cart', (req) => req.continue()).as('cartOnline');
cy.wait('@cartOffline');
cy.get('#checkout').click();
```

